  "body_html": "<p>Místo pro následovníky, které cestou posbíráš, a připomínka toho, co tu hráč vlastně dělá. Následovníci mají plnou sadu vlastností, velmi podobnou nestvůrám, a k tomu <strong>cenu</strong> a <strong>Věrnost</strong> — viz <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"npcs-followers.html\" data-slug=\"npcs-followers\">Vedlejší postavy a Následovníci</a>. Počítadlo HP pod každým následovníkem je sdílené s celým stolem.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"follower\" data-hp-key=\"follower-1\" data-label=\"Follower 1\">\n<h2 id=\"follower-1\">Následovník 1</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Jméno</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"jméno\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Štítky</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-tags\" placeholder=\"tags\" aria-label=\"štítky\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f1-tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-tag0\" data-check-id=\"f1-tag0\"> <span><em>výjimečný</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f1-tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-tag1\" data-check-id=\"f1-tag1\"> <span><em>skupina</em></span></label></li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"Max. HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Max. HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Zbroj\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Zbroj</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Zranění\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Hoď na zranění\">Zranění</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Instinkt</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-instinct\" placeholder=\"to …\" aria-label=\"aby …\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-moves\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tahy</span><ol><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-move0\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"tah\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-move1\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"tah\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-move2\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"tah\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ol></div>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Cena</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-cost\" placeholder=\"what keeps them following\" aria-label=\"co je drží u tebe\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"f1-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Věrnost</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f1-loyalty-0\" title=\"Věrnost 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"f1-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Věrnost 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f1-loyalty-1\" title=\"Věrnost 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"f1-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Věrnost 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f1-loyalty-2\" title=\"Věrnost 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"f1-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Věrnost 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Výbava</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Poznámky</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Poznámky\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"follower\" data-hp-key=\"follower-2\" data-label=\"Follower 2\">\n<h2 id=\"follower-2\">Následovník 2</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Jméno</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"jméno\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Štítky</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-tags\" placeholder=\"tags\" aria-label=\"štítky\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f2-tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-tag0\" data-check-id=\"f2-tag0\"> <span><em>výjimečný</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f2-tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-tag1\" data-check-id=\"f2-tag1\"> <span><em>skupina</em></span></label></li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"Max. HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Max. HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Zbroj\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Zbroj</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Zranění\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Hoď na zranění\">Zranění</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Instinkt</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-instinct\" placeholder=\"to …\" aria-label=\"aby …\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-moves\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Tahy</span><ol><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-move0\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"tah\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-move1\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"tah\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-move2\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"tah\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ol></div>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Cena</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-cost\" placeholder=\"what keeps them following\" aria-label=\"co je drží u tebe\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"f2-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Věrnost</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f2-loyalty-0\" title=\"Věrnost 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"f2-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Věrnost 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f2-loyalty-1\" title=\"Věrnost 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"f2-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Věrnost 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f2-loyalty-2\" title=\"Věrnost 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"f2-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Věrnost 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Výbava</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Poznámky</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Poznámky\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"players-agenda\">Hráčova agenda</h2>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Ztvárňuj poutavou postavu</li><li>Zapojuj se do smyšleného světa</li><li>Hraj, abys zjistil, co se stane</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"players-principles\">Hráčovy zásady</h2>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Začínej i konči fikcí</li><li>Navazuj vztahy s ostatními postavami</li><li>Ukaž nám, co je pro tebe důležité</li><li>Měj cíle a jdi za nimi</li><li>Buď smělý, riskuj</li><li>Přijímej těžkosti, nezdary i prohry</li><li>Podílej se na tvorbě světa</li><li>Stav na tom, co řekli ostatní</li><li>Dávej ostatním šanci zazářit</li><li>Účastni se rozhovoru</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"when-in-doubt\">Když si nevíš rady…</h2>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Představ si situaci</li><li>Požádej Vypravěče o upřesnění</li><li>Co chceš? Jaký máš cíl?</li><li>Zvaž své silné a slabé stránky</li><li>Hledej nápady u ostatních</li><li>Drž se volby zjevné, zajímavé, významné… ne vždycky té „správné\" (pamatuj, za neúspěch dostáváš XP!)</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"triggering-moves\">Spouštění tahů</h2>\n<p>Pokud to chceš udělat, udělej to ve fikci. Pověz nám, jak to děláš a jak to vypadá. Buď konkrétní.</p>\n<p>Ale pamatuj: když to uděláš ve fikci, tak to prostě děláš. „Proběhnu kolem hagra a popadnu zářící meč\" — a Vypravěč řekne, že to je Vzdorovat Nebezpečí s DEX. Je v pořádku říct: „Vážně? Tak to asi nedělám.\" Ale pokud chceš kolem hagra proběhnout, chop se kostek.</p>\n<h2 id=\"hold-and-spend\">Zásoba a její utrácení</h2>\n<p>Když tah říká „drž si X Měny (dokud/zatímco/pokud ___)\", poznač si drženou Měnu a utrácej ji tak, jak tah popisuje. Utracení držené Měny obvykle znamená, že to prostě uděláš, bez hodu.</p>\n<p>Někdy ti ale utracení držené Měny dovolí spustit tah (a tedy házet), když bys to jinak vůbec udělat nemohl.</p>"
}
